SUMMARY:Friends of Bur'uda Hanlon Park working bee
DESCRIPTION:Join us for regular bushcare at Bur'uda Hanlon Park! We will be
  weeding around native plants\, watering any recent plantings and removing
  rubbish. Planting season will be March to May. Meet us at the big lawn ne
 ar Junction St\; look around until you find us. Our working bees are first
  Sunday of the month except January. Please wear long pants\, a hat\, stro
 ng shoes and bring a water bottle. Proudly supported by Brisbane City Coun
 cil.
